# The fight of the battlefield on_my_way (Waughroon Shrine, index 3, Bastok 7-2, status 2): a level 75 Bastokan with
# On My Way current at status 2. BC_Entrance 32000 (the menu, [0,0,0,8]); update option 0: ignored; option 49: area 1
# entered (7610, 7543, 7546). The group of four spawns on the first tick; all killed: allDeath, WON, 32001; its finish
# runs the battlefield's and the mission's (the Letter from Werei, status 3). The leave ticks after.
lists WaughroonShrine/BC_Entrance/onTrigger WaughroonShrine/BC_Entrance/onTrade WaughroonShrine/onEventUpdate/32000 WaughroonShrine/onEventFinish/32000 WaughroonShrine/onEventFinish/32001 WaughroonShrine/onEventFinish/32002 WaughroonShrine/onEventFinish/32003 WaughroonShrine/Burning_Circle/onTrigger
char zone=WaughroonShrine pos=-338.1,104.3,-260.3 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Bastok TheZeruhnReport completed
mission Bastok GeologicalSurvey completed
mission Bastok Fetichism completed
mission Bastok TheCrystalLine completed
mission Bastok WadingBeasts completed
mission Bastok TheEmissary completed
